== the aliases a codegen change runs ==
Every alias named above, once. Hand them to `tools/test-run.sh run build`; an alias re-running
a golden only when a pform reads some value covers that golden on the backend that makes it
so, listed next, and the goldens' families say which backends a change has to be run on.
