== of those, the aliases re-running a golden only on one backend ==
Each re-runs the goldens above whose condition that backend's build meets, and only there: run
a backend's list on a box with OCANNL_BACKEND set to it. Which backend a value means is what
test/config/config_reads.ml -- the code the reader writing the file runs -- writes for it.
cc:
  @test/operations/runtest-micrograd_demo_logging
  @test/operations/runtest-test_where_precision-extension
  @test/operations/runtest-top_down_prec-extension
  @test/operations/runtest-zero_out_local_decl-extension
multidev_cc:
  @test/operations/runtest-micrograd_demo_logging
