== tests calling a backend's compiler with source of their own ==
They pin nothing and build no kernel through the pipeline, and a change to a backend's
builtins prelude, its compiler flags or how its compiler is resolved breaks them all the same
(gh-ocannl-1772): test_shared_builtins compiles Builtins_cc.source and a probe of its own with
Cc_backend.compiler_command. Run a backend's list, at the end, on a box with OCANNL_BACKEND set
to it. The rules are stated in test/support/kernel_exec_scan.ml.
compiler entries, each still spelled by a source handed over:
Cc_backend.compiler_command [cc]
Cc_backend.kernel_compiler_flags [cc]
Cc_backend.kernel_link_flags [cc]
Nvrtc.compile_to_ptx [cuda]
Hip_backend.Impl.hip_to_code [hip]
Library.on_device [metal]

